# Line endings are normalised to LF inside the repository.
#
# This project is written on Windows and runs on Linux in two places: the Pages
# build on GitHub's runners, and the identity server's own runner on the Ubuntu
# box. A shell script or a gradle wrapper checked out with CRLF fails there with
# an error that says nothing useful, so the few files where it is fatal are
# pinned explicitly rather than left to whatever autocrlf happens to be set to.
* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf

# Binary, so git never tries to translate anything inside them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.keystore binary
